{"id":"n82142-5-7","stage":1,"title":"지나다 · 放过","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82142-5-7-1","ko":"지수가 한 얘기 잘 들었어?","zh":"你听清楚智秀刚才说的话了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","explanation":"하다：承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"23","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"얘기","meaning":"谈话，说话","explanation":"얘기：谈话，说话","readings":[{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74194","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘기","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들었어","audio":"/audio/212b440366b02768c97f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc","term":"얘기","zh":"谈话，说话","audio":"/audio/cbb7c3fe2dd88ddc7d2b.mp3","entryId":"74194","definition":"向某人诉说与某事实、状态、现象、经验、想法等有关的话。","pronunciation":["얘ː기"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bec51bbba04f7ead5d7e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82142-5-7-2","ko":"아니, 지나는 말로 건성으로 들었네.","zh":"没有，我只是随便听听而已，并没认真听。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"지나는","meaning":"放过","explanation":"지나다：放过；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"5","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나는","audio":"/audio/84f5225d59a0c44fa4ab.mp3"}},{"text":"말로","meaning":"语言，话","explanation":"말：语言，话；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"3","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말로","audio":"/audio/435b44d506bb612693c5.mp3"}},{"text":"건성으로","meaning":"敷衍，心不在焉","explanation":"건성：敷衍，心不在焉；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"건성","audio":"/audio/7ea4f78b1143d0ff3ef1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23701","senseId":"2","lemma":"건성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건성으로","audio":"/audio/5c890d5240a3bb682581.mp3"}},{"text":"들었네.","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","read